1
00:01:06,270 --> 00:01:09,963
It's a good thing no one saw us when we came in.

2
00:01:15,750 --> 00:01:20,375
I’m sorry I had to lie to you.

3
00:01:23,130 --> 00:01:24,818
I don’t care about that.

4
00:01:25,655 --> 00:01:27,969
You know I know...

5
00:01:29,250 --> 00:01:30,615
unless...

6
00:01:32,449 --> 00:01:34,440
Can I ask you for one thing?

7
00:01:40,920 --> 00:01:43,895
Don't tell my dad who you really are.

8
00:01:52,080 --> 00:01:53,975
But I don't want to live a lie.

9
00:01:56,680 --> 00:01:58,535
And do you not want to be with me?

10
00:02:02,020 --> 00:02:05,883
Everything that happened. you feel the same way I do.

11
00:02:07,810 --> 00:02:08,726
But it's wrong.

12
00:02:10,890 --> 00:02:12,258
It's wrong because of our status,

13
00:02:14,660 --> 00:02:16,055
our birth,

14
00:02:21,280 --> 00:02:22,670
and because we are both women.

15
00:02:30,850 --> 00:02:32,898
If we ignore all of that,

16
00:02:34,520 --> 00:02:36,203
if we don't care who we are,

17
00:02:37,960 --> 00:02:39,427
Would you still love me?

18
00:02:57,950 --> 00:02:58,560
Yes.

19
00:03:04,855 --> 00:03:06,080
I love you.

20
00:03:22,560 --> 00:03:24,252
Then that's enough.

21
00:04:25,920 --> 00:04:30,116
Can I hear you say you love me just one more time?

22
00:04:31,740 --> 00:04:34,732
I love hearing the word "love" from your lips.

23
00:04:44,730 --> 00:04:46,227
If that is what you want,

24
00:04:49,240 --> 00:04:50,295
I will never stop.

25
00:05:42,430 --> 00:05:51,987
What do you think it's like when someone is trapped in the darkness?

26
00:07:05,975 --> 00:07:07,450
How do you feel?

27
00:07:09,040 --> 00:07:13,409
I feel like I want to be touched by you.

28
00:07:42,073 --> 00:07:45,113
I love the scent of jasmine on your body so much.

29
00:07:46,980 --> 00:07:50,898
Especially right now.

30
00:08:34,140 --> 00:08:38,787
This time, I won't be the only one enjoying this happiness.

31
00:09:22,800 --> 00:09:24,658
Your clothes are completely soaked.

32
00:09:26,080 --> 00:09:27,661
I might have to take them off for you.
